The redextape mini-language toolchain

Usage: redextape <COMMAND>

Commands:
  fmt   Format source files in place
  lint  Report parse, type and lint diagnostics
  run   Run a program and print its value
  emit  Compile a program to a backend text form
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
